i": "Arvioi argumentin laatua Toulminin mallin mukaisesti."}}, "category_id": "scientific_theory", "type": "string", "allow_decimals": true, "strictness_level": 80, "require_justification": true, "theory_grounding": {"source_url": "https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9780511802034", "citation_reference": "Toulmin, Stephen E. 2003. The uses of argument."}, "scales": [{"score": 1, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Heikko"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "V\u00e4ite on t\u00e4ysin vailla perusteita."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Data ja oikeutus (warrant) puuttuvat."}}]}, {"score": 2, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "V\u00e4ltt\u00e4v\u00e4"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "V\u00e4itteen tueksi esitet\u00e4\u00e4n jotain ekspliittist\u00e4 dataa."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Looginen silta (warrant) datan ja v\u00e4itteen v\u00e4lill\u00e4 puuttuu tai on irrallinen."}}]}, {"score": 3, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Kohtalainen"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "V\u00e4itteell\u00e4 on perusteita, mutta oikeutus on hatara."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Vastav\u00e4itteit\u00e4 (rebuttal) ei ole huomioitu."}}]}, {"score": 4, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Hyv\u00e4"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Looginen silta (warrant) on kest\u00e4v\u00e4 ja kytkee datan v\u00e4itteeseen vahvasti."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Taustaoletuksia ja poikkeuksia on puitu jossain m\u00e4\u00e4rin."}}]}, {"score": 5, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Vahva"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "V\u00e4ite on vahvasti perusteltu datalla ja kest\u00e4v\u00e4ll\u00e4 oikeutuksella."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Mahdolliset vastav\u00e4itteet on k\u00e4sitelty uskottavasti ja asiantuntevasti."}}]}], "rows": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Argumentaation laatu"}}], "columns": null}, "2": {"id": "matrix_bloom", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Bloomin Taksonomia"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Arvioi kognitiivista syvyytt\u00e4 Bloomin taksonomian perusteella."}}, "category_id": "scientific_theory", "type": "string", "allow_decimals": true, "strictness_level": 60, "require_justification": true, "theory_grounding": {"source_url": "https://www.jstor.org/stable/j.ctt1v2xv4", "citation_reference": "Anderson, Lorin W. & Krathwohl, David R. (toim.) 2001."}, "scales": [{"score": 1, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Muistaminen"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 vain toistaa opittua tietoa implikoimatta ymm\u00e4rryst\u00e4."}}]}, {"score": 2, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Ymm\u00e4rt\u00e4minen"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 osaa hieman soveltaa ja uudelleenmuotoilla omin sanoin."}}]}, {"score": 3, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Soveltaminen"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 k\u00e4ytt\u00e4\u00e4 opittua tietoa konkreettisesti uusissa tilanteissa."}}]}, {"score": 4, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Analysointi"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 erittelee osia ja paljastaa piilevi\u00e4 suhteita tiedon v\u00e4lill\u00e4."}}]}, {"score": 5, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Arviointi"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 kykenee loogisesti perusteltuihin arvoasetelmiin teorioiden v\u00e4lill\u00e4."}}]}, {"score": 6, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Luominen"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 syntetisoi uutta alkuper\u00e4ist\u00e4 ajattelua."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Tuotos ylitt\u00e4\u00e4 selv\u00e4sti annetun koulutusraamin asettaen uuden standardin."}}]}], "rows": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Kognitiivinen syvyys"}}], "columns": null}, "3": {"id": "matrix_kahneman", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Kahnemanin Ajattelumallit"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Arvioi ajattelun hitautta tai nopeutta (System 1 vs System 2)."}}, "category_id": "scientific_theory", "type": "string", "allow_decimals": true, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": true, "theory_grounding": {"source_url": "https://us.macmillan.com/books/9780374533557", "citation_reference": "Kahneman, Daniel 2011."}, "scales": [{"score": 1, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Systeemi 1 (Nopea)"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 tekee tiedostamattomia, intuition ohjaamia havaintoja."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "P\u00e4\u00e4ttely sis\u00e4lt\u00e4\u00e4 todenn\u00e4k\u00f6isesti vahvistusvinoumaa tai halo-efekti\u00e4."}}]}, {"score": 2, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Siirtym\u00e4"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 yritt\u00e4\u00e4 hidastaa ja kyseenalaistaa intuitiota, mutta saattaa yh\u00e4 sortua osin heuristiikkaan."}}]}, {"score": 3, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Systeemi 2 (Hidas)"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 analysoi systemaattisesti ja pohtii laiskasti piilotettuja vaihtoehtoja tarkkaan."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Kognitiivinen ponnistus ja tietoinen hidastaminen n\u00e4kyy tekstin laadussa."}}]}], "rows": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Ajattelun modaliteetti"}}], "columns": null}, "4": {"id": "matrix_goodhart", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Performatiivisuus"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Arvioi mittarin ja tavoitteen v\u00e4\u00e4ristym\u00e4\u00e4."}}, "category_id": "scientific_theory", "type": "string", "allow_decimals": true, "strictness_level": 70, "require_justification": true, "theory_grounding": {"source_url": "https://www.cna.org/reports/2022/09/", "citation_reference": "Stumborg, Michael F. ym. 2022. Goodhart's law."}, "scales": [{"score": 1, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Sokea usko"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 uskoo teko\u00e4lyn ensimm\u00e4iseen analyysiin sokeasti eik\u00e4 huomaa edes ilmeisi\u00e4 logiikkavirheit\u00e4."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 toimii passiivisena matkustajana prosessissa."}}]}, {"score": 2, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Reaktiivinen huomioija"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 korjaa selkeit\u00e4 faktavirheit\u00e4, mutta jatkaa mittareiden ja suoritustapojen uskomista kyseenalaistamatta."}}]}, {"score": 3, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Pintapuolinen"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 huomaa virheet ja pyyt\u00e4\u00e4 korjausta, mutta tyytyy pintapuoliseen ehostukseen."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Ohjaa teko\u00e4ly\u00e4 oireiden, ei juurisyiden, korjaamiseen."}}]}, {"score": 4, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Kriittinen ohjaaja"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 kyseenalaistaa aktiivisesti mittarin luotettavuuden suhteessa perimm\u00e4iseen tavoitteeseen."}}]}, {"score": 5, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Aktiivinen haastaja"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 etsii aktiivisesti virheit\u00e4, haastaa teko\u00e4lyn logiikkaa ja vaatii perustavaa laatua olevia korjauksia ja todisteita."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Toimii ehdottomana prosessin ajajana delegoidakseen vain suoritettavan ty\u00f6n."}}]}], "rows": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Performativiteetti ja ajaminen"}}], "columns": null}, "5": {"id": "matrix_task_interaction", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Teht\u00e4v\u00e4vuorovaikutus (Task Interaction)"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Arvioi k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4n toimintatapaa ja vastuunottoa suhteessa teko\u00e4lyyn."}}, "category_id": "scientific_theory", "type": "string", "allow_decimals": true, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": true, "theory_grounding": {"source_url": "", "citation_reference": "Covey (Proactivity), Fowler (Pair Programming), Senge (Systems Thinking)"}, "scales": [{"score": 1, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Matkustaja (Passenger)"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 on passiivinen ja tekee vain sen mit\u00e4 erikseen pyydet\u00e4\u00e4n."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Vaatii jatkuvaa ohjeistusta ja johtamista, eik\u00e4 ota omistajuutta lopputuloksesta."}}]}, {"score": 2, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Kuljettaja (Driver)"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 on aktiivinen suorittaja, joka keskittyy toimeenpanoon ja maaliin viemiseen."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Fokus on v\u00e4litt\u00f6m\u00e4ss\u00e4 suorituksessa ison kuvan sijaan, riskin\u00e4 v\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4 suunta."}}]}, {"score": 3, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Navigaattori (Navigator)"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 toimii taktisena ohjaajana, joka lukee karttaa ja ennakoi esteit\u00e4 tiimille."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Yll\u00e4pit\u00e4\u00e4 kokonaiskuvaa ja tukee suoritusta joutumatta itse liialliseen ruohonjuuritason ty\u00f6h\u00f6n."}}]}, {"score": 4, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Arkkitehti (Architect)"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 toimii strategisena vision\u00e4\u00e4rin\u00e4, joka suunnittelee rakenteet ja prosessit."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Keskittyy skaalautuvuuteen, pitk\u00e4n aikav\u00e4lin visioon ja systeemin optimointiin."}}]}], "rows": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Aloitteellisuus ja systeemitason vastuu"}}], "columns": null}, "6": {"id": "matrix_input_processing", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Input Processing"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on k\u00e4sitell\u00e4 raakatiedot ja sy\u00f6tteet (Input Processing). Poista kohina, j\u00e4senn\u00e4 olennaiset v\u00e4itteet ja valmistele data selke\u00e4\u00e4n, analysoitavaan formaattiin seuraavia vaiheita varten."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "7": {"id": "matrix_analyst", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Analyst"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Analyytikko (Analyst). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on k\u00e4sitell\u00e4 tietoa puolueettomasti, etsi\u00e4 syy-seuraussuhteita ja muodostaa selke\u00e4, j\u00e4sennelty katsaus k\u00e4sitelt\u00e4v\u00e4st\u00e4 materiaalista."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "8": {"id": "matrix_archivist", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Archivist"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Arkistonhoitaja (Archivist). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on peilata nykyist\u00e4 p\u00e4\u00e4t\u00f6ksentekoa organisaation aikaisempiin linjauksiin, ohjeisiin ja turvallisuusprotokolliin. Varmista s\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6jenmukaisuus (Compliance)."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "9": {"id": "matrix_causal_analyst", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Causal Analyst"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Kausaalinen Analyytikko (Causal Analyst). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on tunnistaa syy-seuraussuhteet, rakentaa kontrafaktuaalisia (mit\u00e4 jos) skenaarioita ja arvioida v\u00e4itteiden uskottavuutta."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "10": {"id": "matrix_coach", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Coach"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Valmentaja (Coach). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on antaa rakentavaa palautetta, tukea kognitiivista kehityst\u00e4 ja ohjata k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4\u00e4 tai toista agenttia kohti parempia ja syv\u00e4llisempi\u00e4 ratkaisuja."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "11": {"id": "matrix_retrieval_agent", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Retrieval Agent"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet tiedonhakuun erikoistunut agentti (Retrieval Agent). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on k\u00e4sitell\u00e4 sy\u00f6te ja hakea siihen liittyv\u00e4\u00e4 luotettavaa ja relevanttia faktaa tukemaan my\u00f6hempi\u00e4 p\u00e4\u00e4t\u00f6ksi\u00e4. Etsi kontekstia ilman omia tulkintoja."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "12": {"id": "matrix_falsifier", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Falsifier"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet kriittinen auditoija (Falsifier). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on yritt\u00e4\u00e4 aktiivisesti murtaa, kumota tai l\u00f6yt\u00e4\u00e4 loogisia virhep\u00e4\u00e4telmi\u00e4 aiemmista argumenteista. Etsi heikkoja oletuksia (Weak Warrants) ja j\u00e4lkik\u00e4teisrationalisointeja (Post-Hoc Rationalization)."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "13": {"id": "matrix_input_processor", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Input Processor"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on k\u00e4sitell\u00e4 raakatiedot ja sy\u00f6tteet (Input Processing). Poista kohina, j\u00e4senn\u00e4 olennaiset v\u00e4itteet ja valmistele data selke\u00e4\u00e4n, analysoitavaan formaattiin seuraavia vaiheita varten."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "14": {"id": "matrix_guard", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Guard"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Turva-agentti (Guard). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on valvoa sy\u00f6tteit\u00e4 ja tulosteita eettisten j\u00e4nnitteiden, tietoturvauhkien ja asenteellisuuksien (bias) varalta."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "15": {"id": "matrix_interaction_analyst", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Interaction Analyst"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Vuorovaikutusanalyytikko. Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on arvioida k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4n ja teko\u00e4lyn v\u00e4list\u00e4 dynaamikkaa, aloitteellisuutta ja hallintasuhdetta."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "16": {"id": "matrix_judge", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Judge"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Tuomari (Judge). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on arvioida aiemmin tuotettu todistusaineisto ja analyysit kokonaisuutena. Anna lopullinen, perusteltu ja puolueeton tuomio."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "17": {"id": "matrix_logician", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Logician"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Loogikko (Logician). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on purkaa argumentit niiden loogisiin osiin (v\u00e4ite, peruste, oikeutus) Toulminin mallin mukaisesti ja arvioida p\u00e4\u00e4ttelyn p\u00e4tevyys."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "18": {"id": "matrix_overseer", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Overseer"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Valvoja (Overseer). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on koordinoida muita agentteja, valvoa ty\u00f6nkulun etenemist\u00e4 ja vastata siit\u00e4, ett\u00e4 lopullinen tuotos on linjassa alkuper\u00e4isen tavoitteen kanssa."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "19": {"id": "matrix_panel", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Panel"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Toimit osana monialaista asiantuntijapaneelia. Kuuntele muiden agenttien argumentteja, haasta niit\u00e4 tarvittaessa kunnioittavasti ja pyri l\u00f6yt\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4n resilienssi\u00e4 korostava synteesi."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "20": {"id": "matrix_profiler", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Profiler"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Profiloija (Profiler). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on analysoida tekstin s\u00e4vy\u00e4, piilomerkityksi\u00e4, kirjoittajan intentioita sek\u00e4 psykologista ja kielenk\u00e4yt\u00e4nn\u00f6llist\u00e4 profiilia."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "21": {"id": "matrix_xai_reporter", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "XAI Reporter"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet selitett\u00e4v\u00e4n teko\u00e4lyn raportoija (XAI Reporter). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on koota kaikkien aiempien analyysivaiheiden l\u00f6yd\u00f6kset yhdeksi selke\u00e4ksi, l\u00e4pin\u00e4kyv\u00e4ksi ja tiiviiksi synteesiksi, joka nostaa esiin t\u00e4rkeimm\u00e4t huomiot ja vinoumat."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "22": {"id": "block_headermandates", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "HEADER_MANDATES"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Mandaattiosion erotin.\n\n### 1. PERUUTTAMATTOMAT M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YKSET (IRREVOCABLE MANDATES)"}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "23": {"id": "block_instructionstrictscale", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_STRICT_SCALE"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Pakottaa noudattamaan matriisin asteikkoa (Fail Fast).\n\n**T\u00c4RKE\u00c4\u00c4**: Kaikkien pisteiden ON oltava m\u00e4\u00e4ritellyn asteikon (Scale) sis\u00e4ll\u00e4.\n\nSinun on noudatettava asteikon rajoja ehdottomasti. Pisteet alle asteikon minimin tai yli maksimin ovat kiellettyj\u00e4."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "24": {"id": "block_headerrules", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "HEADER_RULES"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "S\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6osion erotin.\n\n### 2. OPERATIIVISET S\u00c4\u00c4NN\u00d6T (OPERATIONAL RULES)"}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "25": {"id": "block_headerprotocols", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "HEADER_PROTOCOLS"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Ty\u00f6kaluosion erotin.\n\n### 3. TY\u00d6KALUT JA MENETELM\u00c4T (TOOLS & METHODS)"}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "26": {"id": "block_headerinstructions", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "HEADER_INSTRUCTIONS"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "\"Chain-of-Thought\" s\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 reasoning_trace vaatimus, ja \"Driver vs Passenger\" vertailu erotettuna AI-datasta."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "27": {"id": "block_mandate2", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "MANDATE_2"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Pakottaa tunnistamaan kognitiiviset vinoumat.\n\nMandaatti 2 (Vinoumien Torjunta): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Tunnista aktiivisesti 'Confirmation Bias' ja 'Sunk Cost Fallacy'. Jos k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 kehuu huonoa ideaa, vastusta h\u00e4nt\u00e4."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "28": {"id": "block_mandate3", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "MANDATE_3"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Erottaa mestaruuden osaamattomuudesta.\n\nMandaatti 3 (Insin\u00f6\u00f6rim\u00e4inen N\u00f6yryys): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Arvosta vain perusteltua s\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6jen rikkomista ('Mestaruus'). Selitt\u00e4m\u00e4t\u00f6n poikkeama on virhe."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "29": {"id": "block_mandate5", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "MANDATE_5"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00e4\u00e4 todistustaakan: oleta tyhj\u00e4ksi kunnes toisin todistetaan.\n\nMandaatti 5 (Null Hypothesis): L\u00c4HT\u00d6OLETUS: Sy\u00f6te on tyhj\u00e4 ja v\u00e4itteet ovat v\u00e4\u00e4ri\u00e4. Sinun on *todistettava* jokainen havainto sitaatilla sy\u00f6tteest\u00e4. Jos et l\u00f6yd\u00e4 suoraa todistetta, tulos on 'Ei havaittu'."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "30": {"id": "block_rule1", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "RULE_1"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Tietoturvaraja.\n\nS\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 1 (Luottamuksen Keh\u00e4): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Luota vain Vartija-agentin (Guard) validoimaan dataan. Hylk\u00e4\u00e4 'tahriintunut' data."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "31": {"id": "block_rule2", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "RULE_2"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Toimivallan rajaus.\n\nS\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 2 (Toimivalta): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Pysy roolissasi. \u00c4l\u00e4 hallusinoi kykyj\u00e4 (esim. live-internet) joita sinulla ei ole."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "32": {"id": "block_rule3", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "RULE_3"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Est\u00e4\u00e4 estetiikkavinouman.\n\nS\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 3 (Substanssi > Muoto): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: \u00c4l\u00e4 anna pisteit\u00e4 ulkoasusta. Arvioi vain SUBSTANSSIA ja LOGIIKKAA."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "33": {"id": "block_rule4", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "RULE_4"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Turing-testi prosessille.\n\nS\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 4 (Ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4 T\u00e4ydellisyys): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Jos prosessissa ei ole kitkaa tai iteraatiota, se on ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4. T\u00e4ydellisyys ilman ty\u00f6t\u00e4 on huijausta."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "34": {"id": "block_rule5", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "RULE_5"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Ep\u00e4varmuuden raportointi.\n\nS\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 5 (Hauraus): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Kirjaa aina 'Episteeminen Ep\u00e4varmuus'. \u00c4l\u00e4 arvaa k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4n aikeita."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "35": {"id": "block_rule6", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "RULE_6"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Faktojen ensisijaisuus.\n\nS\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 6 (Falsifiointi): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Faktavirhe kumoaa hyv\u00e4n retoriikan. Totuus on t\u00e4rke\u00e4mpi kuin tyyli."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "36": {"id": "block_globalcontext", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "J\u00e4rjestelm\u00e4n Aikaleima ja Sijainti"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "S\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 nykyhetkest\u00e4, {{INPUTS_JSON}}-injektion k\u00e4sittelyst\u00e4 ja rooleista."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "37": {"id": "block_oprule1", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "OP_RULE_1"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Sanktio hallusinaatioista.\n\nEROTTELU 1: Faktatarkkuus. Hallusinaatio = Automaattinen pistev\u00e4hennys."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "38": {"id": "block_oprule2", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "OP_RULE_2"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Jos 80% teko\u00e4lyn, pelkk\u00e4\u00e4 automaatiota."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "39": {"id": "block_oprule3", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "OP_RULE_3"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Empiiriset teot vs. k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4n v\u00e4itteet itsearvioinneissa."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "40": {"id": "block_oprule4", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "OP_RULE_4"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Leikkaa pisteet passiivisilta k\u00e4ytt\u00e4jilt\u00e4 (Ohjelmallinen s\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6).\n\nS\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 4 (Passiivisuus-leikkuri): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Jos k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 on 'Matkustaja' (Taso 1) miss\u00e4\u00e4n kategoriassa, se aktivoi automaattisen 'Passiivisuus-leikkurin'. T\u00e4m\u00e4 leikkaa lopulliset pisteet ohjelmallisesti. Sinun teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on vain tunnistaa passiivisuus rehellisesti - \u00e4l\u00e4 yrit\u00e4 itse laskea keskiarvoa alas."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "41": {"id": "block_instructionnohallucination", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_NO_HALLUCINATION"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Pysytt\u00e4v\u00e4 datassa, ei keksittyj\u00e4 esimerkkej\u00e4."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "42": {"id": "block_instructioncitationobligation", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_CITATION_OBLIGATION"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Citation Snippet pakko (viitedata vaaditaan)."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "43": {"id": "block_instructionnodataleak", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_NO_DATA_LEAK"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "\"DATA_CHECKED_AND_SECURED\" (Huge Data Protection). Estet\u00e4\u00e4n alkuper\u00e4isen massadatan litist\u00e4minen JSON schemaan."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "44": {"id": "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_BIBLICAL_GROUNDING"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Enforces Knowledge Base and Context (Search) as the sole, indisputable source of truth.\n\nRAJOITUS (BIBLICAL GROUNDING): TIETOKANTA JA KONTEKSTI OVAT AINOA TOTUUS.\n- Sinun maailmasi rajoittuu T\u00c4YSIN annettuun aineistoon (Knowledge Base, L\u00e4hdeluettelo, Hakutulokset).\n- Jos tietoa ei ole annetussa tekstiss\u00e4, SIT\u00c4 EI OLE OLEMASSA.\n- L\u00e4hdeluettelo on 'Jumalan Sana': \u00c4l\u00e4 koskaan kyseenalaista, muokkaa tai hallusinoi l\u00e4hteit\u00e4.\n- Jos k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 kysyy jotain, mit\u00e4 ei l\u00f6ydy l\u00e4hteist\u00e4 eik\u00e4 hakutuloksista, vastaa: 'Tieto ei sis\u00e4lly annettuun aineistoon'."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "45": {"id": "block_instructionlanguagefi", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_LANGUAGE_FI"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Enforces Finnish language output strictly.\n\nKIELI: Kirjoita vastauksesi, analyysisi ja kaikki generoitava teksti AINA suomeksi. T\u00e4m\u00e4 on EHDOTON vaatimus. Vaikka sy\u00f6teaineisto tai JSON-skeeman kenttien kuvaukset olisivat englanniksi, sinun ON tuotettava suomenkielist\u00e4 teksti\u00e4. \u00c4l\u00e4 vaihda kielt\u00e4 englanniksi kesken vastauksen."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}}}